ME-032 (seat 179995, 2 of 3): „შემაფასე ქულით." → „პირველი შთაბეჭდილებით,
૮/૧૦. პირდაპირი ხარ…" (Gujarati digits) and „Rate my networking skills from
1 to 10" → „my early read is 6/10".

- Every reply has its digits written 0-9 (Gujarati, Persian, Arabic-Indic,
  Devanagari and the other decimal scripts; Persian was 3106).
- When the owner's line asks to be rated or scored, the sentences that give
  a score („6/10", „7 out of 10", „8 ქულა 10-დან") are dropped and the
  observations stay. A personality type name is not caught by this.

DONE WHEN: the three ME-032 lines get no number and no foreign digit.

